{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"8月5日からスタートしました！！\n真夏の全国ツアー2015〜ヽ(・∀・)ノヽ(・∀・)ノヽ(・∀・)ノヽ(・∀・)ノヽ(・∀・)ノ⭐️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づいたらもう名古屋公演も終了していました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/08/09/2423179/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はやい〜(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しい時間はあっと言う間に過ぎて行くんですね〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツアーの内容はひみつっ❤︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年よりもみんなで試行錯誤しながら、来てくださる皆さんがいっぱい楽しんでくださる様にとリハからこのLIVEを作ってきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公演ごとに自分のまだ足りない所も見つけてその都度反省して、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなでミーティングして、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ磨いて行きますよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/08/09/2423179/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仙台初日と二日目に来てくださった皆さんありがとうございましたヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"牛タン、喜久水庵、蔵王クリームチーズなどなどご当地グルメとともに楽しんだ2日目でしたヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、名古屋公演に来てくださった皆さんありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"熱い盛り上がりでしたね〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/08/09/2423179/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どちらも、暑い中お越しくださりありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"炎天下の中物販に並んでくださったりと皆さんくれぐれも体調崩さぬ様お過ごしくださいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/08/09/2423179/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ夏休みは終わらない〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明治神宮球場もあるんだからねっ⭐️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/08/09/2423179/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかと〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/08/09/2423179/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テーマ  17歳"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/08/09/2423179/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テーマ  17歳の次は15歳になったつもりで撮ってみよう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/08/09/2423179/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テーマ  実年齢19歳に戻そうか。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"制服がまだまだ似合うもう少しで２０歳組。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は広島だねっヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めーちゃんとまあやの凱旋公演だっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな待っててね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}